message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "MedGraphRAG: Medical Oncology Graph-Augmented RAG System"
authors:
  - family-names: Jain
    given-names: Khushal
repository-code: "https://github.com/khushal15jain/MedGraphRAG"
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-17
keywords:
  - retrieval-augmented-generation
  - knowledge-graph
  - medical-nlp
  - clinical-question-answering
  - large-language-models
abstract: >
  An end-to-end, deterministic, explainable, and hallucination-resistant
  clinical question-answering architecture designed for medical oncology
  guidelines and textbooks. Combines dense semantic search, BM25 lexical
  search, and IDF-weighted multi-hop knowledge graph traversal, fused and
  reranked with a cross-encoder before grounded local generation.
